The zz9000eth AMIX kernel driver (/dev/zz0, major 52, STREAMS/DLPI, polled)
for the MNT ZZ9000's Ethernet port, as two kits for the AMIX Installer:
zz9000eth for the stock 68030 kernel, zz9000eth-040 for the 68040/060 port
kernels.  It is linked beside the zz9000 graphics driver.  No AMIX kernel
is included.
